TITLE: Alpha 0.6 released
ACTION-NEEDED: false

;
This is a bugfix release. No crazy big changes were made:

- Finally use a kernel package (#70)
- Finally include DRM in the kernel config 
- Fixed `car` unable to unpack packages (#69)
  - Run `ldconfig` during rootfs build
- Use the standard runit 3-stage structure
- Move `ireallyloverunit` to its own repo
- Improved the Makefile, deprecated Makefile-fedora

The next release will:

- Use `iwd` instead of just `dhcp`
- Fix shared library issues 

After that, we want to rewrite the installer, and make an ISO builder like `archiso`. Using a Makefile is starting to get messy after months of work on Redrose.
;
